title: Hindenburg dismisses the government!
subtitle: President Hindenburg has lost confidence in the present ministry.
new-page: true
view-if: president = "Hindenburg" and spd_in_government and hindenburg_dissent >= 3 and hindenburg_dissent > coalition_dissent and hindenburg_dismissal_timer <= 0 and hindenburg_enabled = 1 and presidential_powers = 0
#tags: event

= Hindenburg dismisses the government!

# unfortunately, a new governing majority is unable to be formed, as the DNVP refuses to cooperate.
#
# options:
# - we will have new snap elections. 
# - tolerate a new government approved by Hindenburg.

